  "arduino": "// A powered active-high relay switches COM from NC to NO.\n// Each LED has its own current-limiting resistor. Contacts are isolated from IN.\nvoid setup() { pinMode(2, OUTPUT); }\nvoid loop() {\n  digitalWrite(2, HIGH); delay(1000); // Green: COM -> NO\n  digitalWrite(2, LOW);  delay(1000); // Red: COM -> NC\n}\n",
